/* cybersquad's theme layer, loaded after crewui's default.tcss (see
   tools/tui/__init__.py's CSS_PATH). crewui ships the structural CSS; this
   file carries only cybersquad's visual preferences and wins on ties. Keep it
   to look-and-feel - structure and behaviour stay in crewui. */

/* Slimmer scrollbars: half Textual's default vertical width (2 -> 1), so the
   bar reads as a hairline rather than a slab, in every scrollable pane. */
#agent-session, #crew-log, #sidebar {
    scrollbar-size-vertical: 1;
}

/* Breathing room on the right of the agent session: inset its content so the
   turn boxes never butt against the scrollbar, however thin it is. The bar
   sits in the reserved gutter beyond this padding, so it stays in the same
   column as the log pane's bar below. */
#agent-session {
    padding-right: 1;
}
